<section class="relative overflow-hidden pt-16 pb-20 sm:pt-24 sm:pb-28 lg:pt-32 lg:pb-36">
  <!-- Background glow -->
  <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0">
    <div class="absolute -top-40 left-1/2 h-[500px] w-[800px] -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full bg-brand-600/20 blur-[120px]"></div>
    <div class="absolute top-40 right-0 h-72 w-72 rounded-full bg-accent-500/10 blur-[100px]"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="container-narrow relative text-center">
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-brand-500/30 bg-brand-500/10 px-3.5 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-brand-300 mb-6">
      <span class="relative flex h-2 w-2">
        <span class="absolute inline-flex h-full w-full animate-ping rounded-full bg-brand-400 opacity-75"></span>
        <span class="relative inline-flex h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-brand-400"></span>
      </span>
      Updated for mid-2026 creative AI landscape
    </div>

    <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white leading-[1.1] mb-6">
      Exploring the frontiers of
      <span class="gradient-text">Creative AI</span>
    </h1>

    <p class="mx-auto max-w-2xl text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-400 leading-relaxed mb-10">
      From consistent character pipelines and agentic production systems to generative music and design acceleration —
      a clear-eyed look at what creators are actually using today and where the practice is heading.
    </p>

    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4">
      <a href="#current" class="btn-primary">
        Explore the Landscape
      </a>
      <a href="/explorations/" class="btn-secondary">
        View Use Cases
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
